{"__q": {"t": "Модальные глаголы — Сборник 3", "q": [{"s": "Choose: «He might have missed the train» expresses:", "o": ["obligation", "certainty", "past possibility", "ability"], "e": "Предположение о прошлом."}, {"s": "Complete: «You ___ not to tell anyone.»", "o": ["had", "ought", "should", "must"], "e": "Конструкция «ought to»."}, {"s": "Choose: «I was able to finish» means:", "o": ["I could in general", "I may finish", "I managed to do it", "I must finish"], "e": "Конкретный успешный результат."}, {"s": "Complete: «She ___ have been at the party; I saw her at home.»", "o": ["must", "should", "can't", "might"], "e": "Невозможность в прошлом."}, {"s": "Choose: «Need I go?» The negative answer is:", "o": ["No, you mustn't.", "No, you don't need go.", "No, you can't.", "No, you needn't."], "e": "«Needn't» означает отсутствие необходимости."}, {"s": "Complete: «If I had studied, I ___ have passed.»", "o": ["would", "must", "can", "will"], "e": "Условное предложение III типа."}, {"s": "Choose: «Used to» expresses:", "o": ["future plan", "present habit", "past habit no longer true", "obligation"], "e": "Прошлая привычка."}, {"s": "Complete: «He ___ speak three languages.»", "o": ["may to", "should", "can", "must"], "e": "Выражает умение."}, {"s": "Choose the most polite request.", "o": ["Give me water.", "You must give me water.", "Give water!", "Would you mind giving me some water?"], "e": "Это самая вежливая форма."}, {"s": "Complete: «You ___ to apologize.»", "o": ["ought", "must", "can", "should"], "e": "«Ought to» — единственный модальный глагол, требующий «to»."}]}, "Modal Verbs — 3-ci toplu": "Модальные глаголы — Сборник 3"}